                                                "text": "an accumulation of earth, of sand, of evils, of wealth, or of honors"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f05d390d-fae5-3826-81f3-d2ec70789cfd",
                                        "entry_id": "b04d716a-bdb8-3a47-89a2-61373bd6d583",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mass of something piled up or collected."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90bf2ec1-acfe-42d5-b780-c96f19c0a9e4",
                                                "sense_id": "f05d390d-fae5-3826-81f3-d2ec70789cfd",
                                                "text": "After such an accumulation of mistakes in the treatment of lexical items, it comes as no surprise that the section on word formation on p. 133 is equally poor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9406a0ff-2088-3340-8567-cb9a85a7d49b",
